{"subtitle":"","author":"子戈","category":"专栏 · 看片指南","collection":"","publishedAt":"2026-08-03T18:30","status":"published","cover":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-001.jpg","festival":"","partnership":false,"id":"img-9215","title":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么","archiveCategory":"guide","blocks":[{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 1","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-001.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 2","caption":"","width":70,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-002.jpg","imageText":"8月院线看片指南>>"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 3","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-003.jpg","imageText":"最为期待- —1部\nOur Aspiration !"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 4","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-004.jpg","imageText":"《奥德赛》\n8.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:8月14日1第2个周五出品方：环球/导演：克里斯托弗·诺兰目前豆瓣分8.3／预计票房3-6亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点² 诺兰让电影再次伟大？剧情片：动作／历史／冒险／173‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"诺兰岁数越大，越像个知识分子，在《奥本海默》～里关心完人类的前途命运之后，这次他回到更久远的传说中，借荷马史诗《奥德赛》继续书写他的文明衰败史。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"近3个小时的时长，IMAX 65毫米胶片拍摄，1.43:1全画幅·.诺兰这位“电影之子”以当今电影最高规格完成这部新作。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"他能让电影再次伟大吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"值得关注- ——8部It's Noteworthy","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 5","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-005.jpg","imageText":"》\n《年会不能停2！\n张若昀\n饰\n奔\n白客\n马杰 饰\n70\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:8月1日1第1个周六出品方：猫眼&中影／导演：董润年目前豆瓣分6.9／预计票房2-4亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点“穿越”牛马，继续整顿职场。剧情片：喜剧／奇幻／125°","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"三年前，《年会不能停！》替打工牛马们痛痛快快发泄了一把，尽管最后还是要靠明君体恤民情解决终极问题，但至少在过程里，影片还是通过“错位”喜剧，有效讽刺了职场、大厂的种种陋习弊病。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"第二部中，核心宗旨仍然不变，白客饰演的马杰克也以同一角色回归，搭档张若昀，继续整顿职场。此外，主创们还玩起了“穿越梗”，用困在循环中，来表达困在系统里的窘境。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但豆瓣7.0的开分，预示了新作显然未能延续前作势头。续集魔咒，还在应验。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Enterta 《逃出绝命街》","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 6","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-006.jpg","imageText":"期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:8月14日1第2个周五出品方：华纳兄弟&坏机器人导演：大卫·罗伯特·米切尔","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5／票房3000-8000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点²当八十年代街区回到恐龙时代.…．剧情片：动作／科幻／惊悚／100‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"影片概念有点意思，讲一场神秘事件让一个平静的八十年代街区，瞬间穿越回史前时代。于是恐龙开始在街上肆虐，主角一家人要设法逃生。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"导演大卫·罗伯特·米切尔曾执导A24小神片《银湖之底》，当年风头也不让阿里·艾斯特，如今显然是要走主流路线了。不知道在这部新片里，还能保有多少作者风格？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 7","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-007.jpg","imageText":"《大唐妖探》\n日月8日\n70\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:8月15日1第3个周六出品方:猫眼／导演：程腾＆黄珉","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5/票房8000万-1.5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点人妖侦探组合，大闹长安。动画片：喜剧／悬疑／奇幻／117°","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片由《姜子牙》导演程腾和曾参与过《疯狂动物城2》 》《冰雪奇缘》‘等名片的迪士尼视效开发总监黄珉联合执导。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"讲述少年狄仁杰和狼妖捕快阿萨一起追查离奇命案，并发现长安城背后秘密的故事。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"团队过硬，题材也过关，不知道有没有希望成为动画界的“唐探”？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 8","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-008.jpg","imageText":"《冬旅人》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:8月7日1第1个周五出品方：牛鼻子/导演：鲁丹","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房50-200万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点 新疆女性导演的长片首作。剧情片：家庭／新疆／90°","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片由已故藏地导演万玛才旦监制，由新疆九零后导演鲁丹执导，讲述的是俄罗斯族摄影师、汉族少女、塔塔尔族手风琴师在北方小镇偶遇，彼此疗愈、救赎的故事。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"典型的多民族、跨文化叙事，最终落点在于那些不同之中的相通之处，仍能让我们成为对方的支点。本片曾入围上影节亚洲新人单元，对新导演创作有所关注的朋友，不妨一看。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 9","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-009.jpg","imageText":"《偷偷藏不住》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：8月19日1第3个周三（七夕）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：大麦/导演：张裕笛","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房1000-3000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点晋江文学同名小说改编。剧情片：爱情／青春","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"导演张裕笛的前作《倒仓》之前在FIRST拿到了最佳编剧奖，也是校园青春片，也是刻画三人关系，只不过拍的是戏校。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这次改编晋江热门IP小说，走的同样是恬淡清新风。讲的是个暗恋奔现的故事，预告片中规中矩。不过在七夕档的几个备选里，已经算是能看的了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 10","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-010.jpg","imageText":"《密档》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：8月28日1第4个周五出品方：上影集团/导演：郑大圣","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5／票房1000-3000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点女地下党员芳名“沈玉琳”。剧情片：谋谍战／悬疑／上海","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"典型国产谍战片。讲1942年上海沦陷，一对地下党员夫妻临危受命，在危机四伏的宅院里，誓死守护机要卷宗的故事。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"搞笑的是片中李妍锡饰演的女地下党员竟然叫沈玉琳（一字不差）好奇剧组里就没人看《康熙来了》吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 11","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-011.jpg","imageText":"《猫猫的奇幻漂流》（重映）\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:8月15日1第3个周六出品方:Dream Well Studio导演：金兹·兹巴洛迪斯","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"目前豆瓣分8.5／预计票房1000-3000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点²全程无对白猫片（不止有猫动画片：奇幻／冒险／85°","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这部动画曾入选戛纳一种关注单元，还拿到过奥斯卡最佳动画，以约350万美元的低预算，战胜了好莱坞巨头。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"影片主要使用免费开源软件Blender制作，以小团队、跨国合作的方式，完成了有别于大工业生产的轻量级创作方式。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"影片本身质量也没得说，是一则典型的后人类末世寓言，无论抽象还是具体，都可以对应到当下的世界。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 12","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-012.jpg","imageText":"《怒之杀》\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:8月21日1第3个周五出品方:Madriver/导演：让-弗朗索瓦·雷切预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5／票房3000-6000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点英国郭达又来炸街了。剧情片：动作／惊悚／犯罪／95‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"郭达一年一度的杀人秀又要开演了。这次他扮演某富豪的贴身保镖，一场意外袭击导致富豪丧命，郭达被诬陷为凶手，遭到通缉和追杀。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"随即，一场怒火延烧的复仇拉开了惟幕。糙老爷们硬汉片爱好者，不得冲？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 13","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-013.jpg","imageText":"谨慎观看 ——4部\nPlease Don't Watch!"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 14","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-014.jpg","imageText":"《去你的岛》\n5.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：8月7日1第1个周五出品方：光线影业/导演：周浩然预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5/票房1-3亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"槽点² 原著粉大概率要骂街。动画片：爱情／奇幻／119‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"根据晋江文学同名作品改编，原著就是个虐恋、催泪小说，改编成动画后，追求的自然也是原著粉们跑到影院再去爆哭一顿。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看完预告片后，能不能爆哭不好说，爆丑倒是确定了。看两位主角的建模脸，一度以为是主创们想走写实路线一一倘若如此，倒成了亮点一一但看着看着明白了，是想往青涩、单纯里做，又不得要领，最后成了唯美粗两不靠。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"去你的岛？谁爱去谁去吧。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 15","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-015.jpg","imageText":"《我想留在你身边》\n8月19日七夕翼\n5.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期:8月19日丨第3个周三(七夕)出品方:爱奇艺/导演:相国强","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.0／票房800-2000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"槽点好消息是，翻拍的日本片还是可以上映的！剧情片：爱情／奇幻","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"排在“谨慎观看”后面三位的全是七夕档电影，光看名字就知道，都得带上“我你他仁”。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这部翻拍自2016年的日本影片《明日的我与昨日的你约会》，片如其名，直接把核心概念端出，就是讲男孩女孩活在时间逆向的平行世界里，每次相遇，都像是初遇。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"听起来不错，但预告片让人只想直接去看原片。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 16","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-016.jpg","imageText":"《不想失去你》\n5.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：8月19日1第3个周三(七夕)出品方：团圆&猫眼／导演：郑润奇预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.0／票房500-1000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"槽点 校园版《给阿嬷的情书》？剧情片：爱情／青春","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看到导演名字，惊着了。竟然是《给阿嬷的情书》里外孙的扮演者，也就是导演蓝鸿春“潮汕三部曲”的御用演员郑润奇。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"潮汕新浪潮真的来了！但这回“狗兄”（昵称）拍的是平平无奇的普通话青春片。终究浪潮，还要归于大海呀。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"听说诺兰让电影再次伟大了？丨8月院线看什么 · 配图 17","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-9215/fig-017.jpg","imageText":"《偷偷喜欢你》\n4.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：8月19日1第3个周三(七夕）出品方：阿荣影业/导演：邱皓洲预计：豆瓣分5.0-6.0／票房600-1500万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"槽点“喜欢”俩字让你听到吐。剧情片：爱情／校园／青春／115‘","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"光看预告片就听了不下十次的“喜欢”。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"“你真的喜欢他吗？”，“你喜欢我吗？”，“你不是喜欢她吗？”，“你是不是喜欢上别人了？”，“我喜欢这个男生很久了”，“她喜欢你，你喜欢她，我喜欢谁重要吗？”","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这哪是“偷偷喜欢你”？这不就是“明着喜欢你”嘛。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"编辑/子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"排版/令令奇","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"*本文配图来自网络","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"欢迎参与投票！","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"你觉得《奥德赛》的中国票房能有多少？单选 单选","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"A.也就3个亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"B.破5亿没问题","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"C.10亿+妥妥的","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"D.超过20亿也不是没可能","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"E.路过只看结果","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"投票","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"preface":[{"text":"暑期档竞争进入白热化阶段， 《功夫女足》《八仙！》的热度仍未消退， 《蜘蛛侠：薪新之日》《奥德赛》两部引进片王炸已顺利接棒。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"不知道后面还有没有大家伙？但诺兰在这个8月的及时归来，已足够令影迷、影市感到振奋。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"尽管这是部根植于荷马史诗的西方故事，但胶片、IMAX、近3小时片长的最高规则，怎能不令人恍然觉得电影又好起来了?","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"稿主笔子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"prefaceOffset":2}